    "source": "// Fade — PWM brightness ramp on pin 9 using analogWrite().\n// Wire an LED + 220 ohm resistor from pin 9 to GND (the virtual board has one).\n\nint brightness = 0;\nint step = 5;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(9, OUTPUT);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  analogWrite(9, brightness);\n  brightness += step;\n  if (brightness <= 0 || brightness >= 255) {\n    step = -step;\n  }\n  delay(20);\n}\n",
