    "source": "// SinePlotter — stream two waves for the Serial Plotter tab.\n// Each line is \"name:value name:value\" which the plotter turns into series.\n\nfloat phase = 0.0;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  Serial.begin(115200);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  Serial.print(\"sin:\");\n  Serial.print(sin(phase) * 100.0);\n  Serial.print(\" cos:\");\n  Serial.println(cos(phase) * 50.0);\n  phase += 0.15;\n  if (phase > TWO_PI) phase -= TWO_PI;\n  delay(30);\n}\n",
