    "source": "// EchoUppercase — read what you type in the Serial Monitor and send it\n// back in UPPERCASE. Also toggles the LED for every line received.\n\nbool led = false;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  Serial.begin(115200);\n  pinMode(LED_BUILTIN, OUTPUT);\n  Serial.println(\"Type something and press Send...\");\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  while (Serial.available() > 0) {\n    char c = Serial.read();\n    if (c >= 'a' && c <= 'z') c = c - 'a' + 'A';\n    Serial.print(c);\n    if (c == '\\n') {\n      led = !led;\n      digitalWrite(LED_BUILTIN, led ? HIGH : LOW);\n    }\n  }\n}\n",
    "summary": "Echo serial input back in uppercase.",
