    "source": "// TrafficLight — a little state machine driving three LEDs.\n// Red on pin 12, yellow on pin 11, green on pin 10.\n\nconst int RED = 12;\nconst int YELLOW = 11;\nconst int GREEN = 10;\n\nvoid show(int r, int y, int g) {\n  digitalWrite(RED, r);\n  digitalWrite(YELLOW, y);\n  digitalWrite(GREEN, g);\n}\n\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(RED, OUTPUT);\n  pinMode(YELLOW, OUTPUT);\n  pinMode(GREEN, OUTPUT);\n  Serial.begin(115200);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  Serial.println(\"GREEN\");\n  show(LOW, LOW, HIGH);\n  delay(2000);\n  Serial.println(\"YELLOW\");\n  show(LOW, HIGH, LOW);\n  delay(700);\n  Serial.println(\"RED\");\n  show(HIGH, LOW, LOW);\n  delay(2000);\n}\n",
    "summary": "Three-LED state machine on pins 10–12.",
