    "source": "// KnightRider — a scanning light across pins 2..8.\n\nconst int FIRST = 2;\nconst int LAST = 8;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  for (int p = FIRST; p <= LAST; p++) pinMode(p, OUTPUT);\n}\n\nvoid light(int pin) {\n  digitalWrite(pin, HIGH);\n  delay(70);\n  digitalWrite(pin, LOW);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  for (int p = FIRST; p <= LAST; p++) light(p);\n  for (int p = LAST - 1; p > FIRST; p--) light(p);\n}\n",
    "summary": "Scanning light across pins 2–8.",
